{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>LUMEVRA 是一款橫跨 iPhone、iPad 與 Mac 的繪畫工作室，適合隨手畫草圖、繪製插畫及整理創作項目。它提供圖層、筆刷、色彩與跨裝置同步等功能，讓用戶由第一筆到完成細節都能在熟悉裝置上進行。現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99，適合喜歡數碼繪畫及需要跨裝置創作的人士。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-234.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>跨裝置圖層創作</h2>\n<p>可把畫布放大至全螢幕，自訂筆刷並以手指或 Apple Pencil 繪畫；將背景、線稿、色彩與細節分層，調整不透明度、混合模式、遮罩及透明度鎖定。亦可從照片擷取顏色、調整亮度對比與曲線，並用選取、變形、格線及透視輔助精修。支援 iCloud 同步、離線保存、Apple Watch 快速草稿、作品分類及縮時錄影匯出。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-86-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-87-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-88-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-89-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-90-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：LUMEVRA: Drawing &amp; Painting</li><li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/lumevra-drawing-painting/id6816342862?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:10:18.038734+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:45:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:33.201010+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:03:51.942707+00:00","content_hash":"4a29961bba9aff939e46bf071b56f2a0e7e79f13934fe95bae392526db5fb32f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}